Script /mice/LAD/scripts/2_run_HHM_ploidy.py outputs several types of files.

1) Full summary 
Includes sample name, number of distributions fitting vaf distribution (Ncl),
quality of HMM  asymmetry model on clonal and subclonal subsets (subsets_fit),
observed-to-expected ratios of cloanl-subclonal states 1-1(o_e_11), 3-3 (o_e_33), 3-1 (o_e_31), 1-3(o_e_13),
classification based on correspondance of asymmetry states between clonal and subclonal mutations (ASS).

/mice/LAD/results/Ploidy_summary.tsv

2) Segments of WC asymmmetry for each sample
/mice/LAD/results/HMM_as_result/*_intervals_HMMas.bed

3) Segments of multiallelic states for each sample
/mice/LAD/results/HMM_multi_result/*_intervals_HMMmulti.bed

4) Multiallelic states for each site in eachsample
/mice/LAD/results/HMM_multi_result/*.tsv